{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57569","headline":"西方歌 · 无名氏","name":"西方歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西方白虎本属阴，爲男爲女亦爲金。\n长立子宫胎产午，成形兑体坎同心。\n娇姿玉貌欺冰雪，素质含光洒轻血。\n则知唤作白琅玕，怎识我身是明月。\n无媒自嫁得黄芽，生死在归戊己家。\n炎烈下时寒国上，阴阳催强緫成砂。\n若人会得吾此语，目前便是三清路。\n驾鹤冲天日有菁定知永劫抛尘土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}